      "claim": "The Notes section states \"The prototype counted 175 changed tokens by `size_gate`, against the `bug` ceiling of 1300,\" but at this snapshot `size_gate` (since SA-0274) subtracts every changed-token count under the repo's declared `test_paths` (`tests/**`) before comparing to the ceiling, reporting the excluded amount only as a caveat. Since this spec's entire `touches` is one file under `tests/**`, the real `size_gate` would report `0 changed tokens within the bug ceiling of 1300 (175 changed tokens under the declared test paths, not counted)`, not \"175 ... against the ceiling\" as stated. Verified by running `size_gate` directly against a synthetic diff restricted to that file. No gating outcome changes (size is advisory at this risk tier regardless, and both 0 and 175 are far under 1300), so this costs nothing to leave, but the sentence is not true of the current code.",
